  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Harness / domain seam",
      "items": [
        "src/harness has no CI/CD vocabulary; tests/test_layering.py fails the build if a domain word or import appears",
        "The CI/CD domain is injected at one composition root, src/api/deps.py (AppContext)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Gate before remediate",
      "items": [
        "Any refuted citation escalates as evidence_refuted",
        "Too few claims verified escalates as evidence_unverifiable",
        "final_confidence below 0.70 escalates as low_confidence; category unknown escalates too",
        "The run budget bounds every stage with asyncio.wait_for; a timeout ends the run"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Acting safely",
      "items": [
        "policy.yaml denies by default; the gateway re-checks the forbidden set on its own",
        "A held plan is saved as an approval row; POST /v1/approvals re-runs the policy, then executes through the gateway",
        "Approvals are single-use: 409 once decided, 410 once expired",
        "HARNESS_DRY_RUN defaults to true, so write tools report what they would do"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Live-mode gate",
      "items": [
        "A 1 MiB body cap answers 413 on every route before the body is read",
        "In live mode POST /v1/runs and /v1/approvals need the operator token (401 without it); a decision is recorded as decided by the operator",
        "Admission answers 429 past 3 x max_concurrent_runs; a verified webhook delivery is counted but never refused",
        "Every sha, ref and path from the model or a caller is validated and encoded before it reaches a URL or a fixture file name",
        "The harness names the fix branch agent/fix/<signature>, drops .github/ paths, and the gateway refuses writes outside agent/fix/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Trace and redaction",
      "items": [
        "Every stage, tool call and model attempt is a span, bound to its run by run_scope",
        "The Redactor scrubs secrets from spans, log lines, stored rows and served bodies",
        "GET /v1/runs/{id}/trace and /runs/{id}/view read spans back, scrubbed again on the way out"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Deployment",
      "items": [
        "Docker: uvicorn serves src.api.main:app on :8000 as UID 1000; compose publishes it on 127.0.0.1 only",
        "HF Space: app.py mounts the same app under Gradio on :7860",
        "HARNESS_GATEWAY=replay by default; live mode needs gateway=github plus an allowlisted repo",
        "Since 2026-10-04 the Space runs live: gateway=github, Shakti8125/harness-demo-repo allowlisted, gemini-3.5-flash-lite, dry run on",
        "HARNESS_FAULT_INJECT wraps the LLM client for failure drills"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
